<item><title>Equatorial Guinea and France examine cultural and French-teaching proposals</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/equatorial-guinea-and-france-examine-cultural-and-french-0ae0a8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/equatorial-guinea-and-france-examine-cultural-and-french-0ae0a8/</guid><category>Equatorial Guinea</category><description>At a meeting in Mongomo, officials discussed training cultural workers, teaching French and improving preparation for French teachers.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:14:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gq.jpg" length="36574" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gq.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
